      "prompt": "C is 5×2 and D is 2×7. Which statement is correct?",
      "dimension": "C",
      "critical": true,
      "options": [
        "Both CD and DC are defined, with different shapes of 5×7 and 2×2",
        "CD is 2×2 and DC is 7×5, as the inner dimensions are swapped in the product",
        "CD is defined and is 5×7; DC is not defined",
        "CD is not defined, because the dimensions of C and D differ"
      ],
      "answer": "2",
      "explanation": "Inner dimensions must match: (5×2)(2×7) gives 5×7. For DC the inner sizes are 7 and 5."
